        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we expand our content licensing services to international markets, we believe that we may face greater competition from established content licensing and talent management companies.",
        "start_character": 34866,
        "end_character": 35051
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Digital content licensing services, through which we manage and license content on behalf of leading rights holders to end users in the film, television, sports, and advertising industries.",
        "start_character": 15656,
        "end_character": 15845
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we contract with select third-party engineering services to support development and quality assurance testing.",
        "start_character": 36313,
        "end_character": 36436
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we may compete with smaller competitors, including developers of AI models, who may develop their own solutions that perform similar services as our platform for specific use cases, as well as with systems integrators that aggregate and integrate cognitive solutions from multiple providers for their clients.",
        "start_character": 31288,
        "end_character": 31610
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through October 17, 2024, we operated a full-service advertising agency through a wholly-owned subsidiary, Veritone One (as defined below), that leveraged aiWARE to provide differentiated Managed Services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 2885,
        "end_character": 3107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Until the sale of Veritone One in October 2024 pursuant to the Divestiture, we marketed and sold our advertising Managed Services through a combination of our direct sales and indirect channel sales.",
        "start_character": 28241,
        "end_character": 28440
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also cross-sell additional products and services, including media management and aiWARE, to our content licensor partners.",
        "start_character": 28115,
        "end_character": 28240
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer cloud-native digital content management solutions and content licensing and representation services.",
        "start_character": 1723,
        "end_character": 1837
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct sales and marketing activities related to our Software Products & Services through a combination of our direct sales force and indirect channel partners such as value-added resellers (“VARs”), distributors, system integrators, managed services providers and referral partners.",
        "start_character": 25854,
        "end_character": 26141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct sales and marketing activities relating to our digital content licensing Managed Services business through our direct sales representatives who identify, develop and manage our relationships with strategic Commercial Enterprise customers in the advertising, entertainment/documentary and network broadcasting industries.",
        "start_character": 27543,
        "end_character": 27874
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face competition from third parties for our content licensing Managed Services, including IMG, Thomson Reuters Getty Images and Shutterstock, particularly in North America;",
        "start_character": 34346,
        "end_character": 34521
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-025214",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-025214-5af7dfefc5851a81",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-025214",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate revenue primarily through the delivery of our Software Products & Services (as defined below) across our Commercial Enterprise (“Commercial Enterprise”) and Public Sector (“Public Sector”) divisions, and secondarily from Managed Services (as defined below) that today include the delivery of content licensing, influencer management and related services within Commercial Enterprise.",
